# LBA2's saves on a wide screen of 852x480 (fixtures/widesaves: the
# saves of fixtures/saves, outside the prison's back door, and its
# lba.cfg with WideScreen: ON, recorded with -D 1920x1080). The main
# menu's Load Game lists them in the window, and Cyd loads, grown out of
# its frame's place in the window to the whole screen. S saves the game
# on the list's New Game line as zed, its picture the window's middle of
# the scene. Twinsen walks and opens the door, and L lists the saves,
# zed's picture in the window: zed loads, grown out of it to the whole
# screen, Twinsen back outside the door.
hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot list
key Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 0.3
shot zoom
sleep 12
shot start
key s
sleep 2
shot slist
key End
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 1
key z e d
sleep 0.5
key Return
sleep 3
shot saved
down Up
sleep 0.8
up Up
sleep 1
key space
sleep 8
shot inside
key l
sleep 2
shot llist
key End
sleep 1
key Up
sleep 1
shot zed
key Return
sleep 0.3
shot zoom2
sleep 8
shot loaded
